# Build context allowlist for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Everything is excluded unless listed, so .env files, data/, .venv/, mlruns/ and app/ never reach the builder,
# even when the image is built from a working copy instead of a release tarball.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!agent/
!api/
!ml/
!data_engineering/
!deploy/serve.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
